Laravel Dox <code>php artisan make:migration create_users_table</code> <code>dox make:migration create_users_table</code> <code>database/migrations/</code> <code>db/migration/</code> <code>Schema::create('users', function (Blueprint $table) {...})</code> <code>await schema.create('users', (Table table) {...})</code> <code>$table-&gt;id();</code> <code>table.id();</code> <code>$table-&gt;string('email')-&gt;unique();</code> <code>table.string('email').unique();</code> <code>$table-&gt;foreignId('user_id')-&gt;constrained()-&gt;cascadeOnDelete();</code> <code>table.foreignId('user_id').constrained().cascadeOnDelete();</code> <code>$table-&gt;timestamps();</code> <code>table.timestamps();</code> <code>$table-&gt;softDeletes();</code> <code>table.softDeletes();</code> <code>$table-&gt;string('name', 100)-&gt;nullable()-&gt;change();</code> <code>table.string('name', 100).nullable().change();</code> <code>Schema::dropIfExists('users');</code> <code>await schema.dropIfExists('users');</code> <code>php artisan migrate</code> <code>dox migrate</code> (or <code>dox migration:run</code>) <code>php artisan migrate:rollback --step=2</code> <code>dox migration:rollback --step=2</code> <code>php artisan migrate:reset</code>, <code>migrate:refresh</code>, <code>migrate:status</code> <code>dox migration:reset</code>, <code>migration:refresh</code>, <code>migration:status</code> db/migration/2026_10_21_120000_create_users_table.dart<pre><code>class CreateUsersTable extends Migration {
  @override
  Future&lt;void&gt; up(Schema schema) async {
    await schema.create('users', (Table table) {
      table.id();
      table.string('email').unique();
